# =============================================================================
# DEPRECATED - This file is no longer the primary configuration method
# =============================================================================
#
# Configuration is now done via JSON configuration file with the --config flag.
# Please use config.example.json instead.
#
# This file is kept for backward compatibility only and will be removed in a
# future release.
#
# For new deployments, please follow the Quick Start guide in README.md
# which uses Docker Compose with JSON configuration.
#
# =============================================================================

# For reference, the new JSON config structure uses nested keys like:
# {
#   "bootstrap": {
#     "session_secret": "...",
#     "debug": false,
#     ...
#   },
#   "database": {
#     "sql_dsn": "...",
#     ...
#   },
#   ...
# }
#
# See config.example.json in the project root for the complete configuration schema.